Face3D Likeness (Blender extension), GPL-3.0-or-later.

Vendored engine
  The extension vendors the `face3d` engine (numpy + Python standard library
  only) under `engine/face3d/`. Engine source files carry
  `SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT` headers, added at build time where missing;
  MIT is compatible with distribution inside this GPL-3.0-or-later package.

Assets
  CC0-1.0 assets bundled: none yet. The procedural template head is generated
  at first run by the extension's own code, so no mesh asset is shipped. Any
  future asset must be listed in assets.toml with licence CC0-1.0 or the build
  is refused.

Not bundled
  No Python wheels and no machine-learning model weights are bundled. Landmark
  detection uses a user-supplied, SHA-256-pinned model file and the user's own
  Python environment (DESIGN 6.7, D-28).
